      "created_at": "2023-04-14T15:07:51.148Z",
      "cooked": "<p><em>All</em> of the wiki is fan-created! I was thinking that a web interface might be more convenient to navigate than a PDF, especially for users on a phone. It’s already got EE rule clarifications; as far as I know you’re the first to publish a DE strategy guide and I see no reason why each character couldn’t have a strategy overview section!</p>",
